{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":19,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"To the chief Musician, A Psalm of David.","tok":[{"t":"To the chief "},{"t":"Musician","s":["H5329"],"a":[0]},{"t":", A "},{"t":"Psalm","s":["H4210"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"David","s":["H1732"],"a":[2]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":1,"text":"The heavens declare the glory of God; and the firmament sheweth his handywork.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"heavens","s":["H8064"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"declare","s":["H5608"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"glory","s":["H3519"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"God","s":["H0410"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; and the "},{"t":"firmament","s":["H7549"],"a":[7]},{"t":" sheweth "},{"t":"his","s":["H5046"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"handywork","s":["H4639"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Day unto day uttereth speech, and night unto night sheweth knowledge.","tok":[{"t":"Day","s":["H3117"],"a":[0]},{"t":" unto "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"uttereth","s":["H5042"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"speech","s":["H0562"],"a":[3]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"night","s":["H3915"],"a":[4]},{"t":" unto "},{"t":"night","s":["H3915"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"sheweth","s":["H2331"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"knowledge","s":["H1847"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"There is no speech nor language, where their voice is not heard.","tok":[{"t":"There is no "},{"t":"speech","s":["H0562"],"a":[1]},{"t":" nor "},{"t":"language","s":["H1697"],"a":[3]},{"t":", where their "},{"t":"voice","s":["H6963"],"a":[6]},{"t":" is not "},{"t":"heard","s":["H8085"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Their line is gone out through all the earth, and their words to the end of the world. In them hath he set a tabernacle for the sun,","tok":[{"t":"Their "},{"t":"line","s":["H6957"],"a":[3]},{"t":" is gone "},{"t":"out","s":["H3318"],"a":[2]},{"t":" through all the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and their "},{"t":"words","s":["H4405"],"a":[6]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"end","s":["H7097"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"world","s":["H8398"],"a":[5]},{"t":". In them hath he "},{"t":"set","s":["H7760"],"a":[8]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"tabernacle","s":["H0168"],"a":[9]},{"t":" for the "},{"t":"sun","s":["H8121"],"a":[7]},{"t":","}]},{"n":5,"text":"Which is as a bridegroom coming out of his chamber, and rejoiceth as a strong man to run a race.","tok":[{"t":"Which is as a "},{"t":"bridegroom","s":["H2860"],"a":[1]},{"t":" coming "},{"t":"out","s":["H3318"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of his "},{"t":"chamber","s":["H2646"],"a":[3]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"rejoiceth","s":["H7797"],"a":[4]},{"t":" as a strong "},{"t":"man","s":["H1368"],"a":[5]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"run","s":["H7323"],"a":[6]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"race","s":["H0734"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"His going forth is from the end of the heaven, and his circuit unto the ends of it: and there is nothing hid from the heat thereof.","tok":[{"t":"His going "},{"t":"forth","s":["H4161"],"a":[2]},{"t":" is from the "},{"t":"end","s":["H7097"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"heaven","s":["H8064"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and his "},{"t":"circuit","s":["H8622"],"a":[3]},{"t":" unto the "},{"t":"ends","s":["H7098"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of it: and there is nothing "},{"t":"hid","s":["H5641"],"a":[7]},{"t":" from the "},{"t":"heat","s":["H2535"],"a":[8]},{"t":" thereof."}]},{"n":7,"text":"The law of the LORD is perfect, converting the soul: the testimony of the LORD is sure, making wise the simple.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"law","s":["H8451"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"perfect","s":["H8549"],"a":[2]},{"t":", "},{"t":"converting","s":["H7725"],"a":[3]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[4]},{"t":": the "},{"t":"testimony","s":["H5715"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"],"a":[6]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"sure","s":["H0539"],"a":[7]},{"t":", making "},{"t":"wise","s":["H2449"],"a":[8]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"simple","s":["H6612"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"The statutes of the LORD are right,